  "description": "MCPInvoke is a complete Model Context Protocol (MCP) server implementation for ASP.NET Core applications. Originally designed as a companion to MCPBuckle for tool execution, MCPInvoke now provides full MCP protocol support including tool discovery and execution. Version 1.3.1 aligns with MCPBuckle 1.5.1 and adds a comprehensive test suite.",
